  "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyLastUpdated": "Last Updated: July 2026",
  "privacyIntro": "Your privacy is our priority. FitTracker is designed to work entirely on your device with no data collection.",
  "privacySection1Title": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacySection1Body": "FitTracker does not collect, store, or transmit any personal information. All data you enter — including weight, height, age, goals, and measurements — is stored locally on your device only.",
  "privacySection2Title": "2. How We Use Your Data",
  "privacySection2Body": "Your data is used exclusively to provide in-app functionality:\n\n- Display your measurements and progress\n- Calculate BMI, calorie needs, and macro splits\n- Track your goals over time\n\nNo data is processed on external servers.",
  "privacySection3Title": "3. Data Storage",
  "privacySection3Body": "All data is stored locally using Hive and flutter_secure_storage. Data persists only on your device and is removed when you delete the app or use the 'Delete All Data' option in Settings.",
  "privacySection4Title": "4. Third-Party Services",
  "privacySection4Body": "FitTracker does not integrate any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking services. The app functions fully offline.",
  "privacySection5Title": "5. Notifications",
  "privacySection5Body": "If enabled, notifications are scheduled locally on your device. No notification data is sent externally.",
  "privacySection6Title": "6. Children's Privacy",
  "privacySection6Body": "FitTracker does not knowingly collect any data from children. Since no data is collected at all, children can use the app safely.",
  "privacySection7Title": "7. Changes to This Policy",
  "privacySection7Body": "Any changes to this privacy policy will be reflected in the app. Since the app operates offline, you will be notified of changes in the next update.",
  "privacySection8Title": "8. Contact",
  "privacySection8Body": "If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at support@fittracker.app.",

  "termsTitle": "Terms & Conditions",
  "termsLastUpdated": "Last Updated: July 2026",
  "termsIntro": "By using FitTracker, you agree to the following terms and conditions.",
  "termsSection1Title": "1. Acceptance of Terms",
  "termsSection1Body": "By downloading, installing, or using FitTracker, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the app.",
  "termsSection2Title": "2. Use of the App",
  "termsSection2Body": "FitTracker is provided for personal, non-commercial use. You agree not to:\n\n- Modify, reverse-engineer, or distribute the app\n- Use the app for any unlawful purpose\n- Attempt to extract data from other users (the app has no network features)",
  "termsSection3Title": "3. Data Responsibility",
  "termsSection3Body": "You are solely responsible for the data you enter into the app. The developers are not responsible for data loss. Regular backups are recommended through your device's backup system.",
  "termsSection4Title": "4. Disclaimer",
  "termsSection4Body": "FitTracker is provided 'as is' without warranty of any kind. The developers are not liable for any damages arising from the use of this app. Health and fitness information provided is for reference only and is not medical advice.",
